        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 20.43,
          "end": 22.45,
          "en": "even though it's not super beautiful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.45,
          "end": 24.3,
          "en": "And let's say here, we have a button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.69,
          "end": 28.54,
          "en": "Where I have a text of set goal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.54,
          "end": 32.44,
          "en": "and when this button is clicked, I wanna save my goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.44,
          "end": 35.66,
          "en": "So for that I'm going to add a script here in managed goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 35.66,
          "end": 39.07,
          "en": "and add a method and I'll keep it very simple here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 39.07,
          "end": 42.21,
          "en": "I'll named as goal at this method setGoal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.21,
          "end": 44.81,
          "en": "And in here, I then want to check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.81,
          "end": 47.56,
          "en": "what's inside of the input, and if it's empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.56,
          "end": 50.15,
          "en": "I wanna show an error message to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.15,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "If it's a valid goal, will not do anything here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 55.45,
          "en": "because I want to focus on that error part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.45,
          "end": 57.003,
          "en": "and on the error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 58.07,
          "end": 61.8,
          "en": "So here we point at setGoal, and instead of setGoal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 61.8,
          "end": 66.8,
          "en": "we can get our entered value with help of refs, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.29,
          "end": 70.15,
          "en": "or with V-model and two-way binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.15,
          "end": 72.89,
          "en": "But here, I'll bring back that ref concept,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.89,
          "end": 75.21000000000001,
          "en": "add my ref key to the input element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.47,
          "end": 80.203,
          "en": "and give it an identifier of my choice, in this case goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.37,
          "end": 83.94,
          "en": "And then here with dollar sign refs.goal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.94,
          "end": 86.18,
          "en": "we can get access to this input element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.18,
          "end": 87.7,
          "en": "and therefore, with dot value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.7,
          "end": 89.60300000000001,
          "en": "we can get the value the user entered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 95.303,
          "en": "And now if entered value is an empty string, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.25999999999999,
          "end": 98.7,
          "en": "then I want to show an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.7,
          "end": 99.9,
          "en": "Now here in the browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.9,
          "end": 102.56,
          "en": "we can use the alert function for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.56,
          "end": 105.22999999999999,
          "en": "Input must not be empty.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.22999999999999,
          "end": 106.813,
          "en": "That's a message we could output here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 106.813,
          "end": 108.82,
          "en": "and the alert function is availiable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 108.82,
          "end": 110.193,
          "en": "in the browser like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 115.997,
          "en": "So if we now save that, and go back here and manage goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.41,
          "end": 118.84,
          "en": "we now have a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 118.84,
          "end": 122.52,
          "en": "and if I enter nothing here and I press Set Goal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.52,
          "end": 124.083,
          "en": "I get my alert here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 125.18,
          "end": 127.28,
          "en": "This works, but in most applications,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 127.28,
          "end": 130.3,
          "en": "you probably don't wanna show an alert like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.3,
          "end": 134.02,
          "en": "This built in alert is not really nice to look at,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 134.02,
          "end": 136.36,
          "en": "it probably doesn't fit the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.36,
          "end": 138.16,
          "en": "of the rest of your application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 138.16,
          "end": 141.8,
          "en": "and therefore, this is maybe not what you wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.8,
          "end": 144.94,
          "en": "Instead, maybe you want to build your own alert,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.94,
          "end": 146.47,
          "en": "your own model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.47,
          "end": 150.3,
          "en": "So your own overlay dialogue, which you wanna show.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.3,
          "end": 152.3,
          "en": "And that's exactly what I'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.3,
          "end": 156.78,
          "en": "I'll build my ErrorAlert.vue component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 156.78,
          "end": 160.21,
          "en": "And that will be a very simple component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 160.21,
          "end": 162.76,
          "en": "which uses to build in dialogue element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 162.76,
          "end": 167.76,
          "en": "which has a default HTML element, to output some content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.07,
          "end": 170.39,
          "en": "And actually here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.39,
          "end": 173.87,
          "en": "we could use some slot content to be flexible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 173.87,
          "end": 176.573,
          "en": "regarding what's shown in that dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.05,
          "end": 182.85,
          "en": "Now I will add some scoped styling here real quick,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.85,
          "end": 184.78,
          "en": "targeting this dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.78,
          "end": 189.78,
          "en": "giving it a position of fixed top 20vh",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 190.06,
          "end": 194.58,
          "en": "to move it 20% down from the top of your window,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 194.58,
          "end": 199.25,
          "en": "left 30% here, whoops, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 199.25,
          "end": 204.25,
          "en": "and give it a width of, let's say 40%,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 208.13,
          "en": "so that we have a centered dialogue here in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 208.13,
          "end": 213.113,
