        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.7,
          "end": 217.9,
          "en": "to have a light drop shadow here in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.17000000000002,
          "end": 221.19,
          "en": "But that's just some basic styling,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.19,
          "end": 224.65,
          "en": "I'll always add a padding of one REM and that's it for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.65,
          "end": 226.82,
          "en": "You can definitely style this in a more beautiful way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.82,
          "end": 228.67000000000002,
          "en": "but that should do the trick for now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.8,
          "end": 232.9,
          "en": "So now we have this dialog where the exact content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.9,
          "end": 236.68,
          "en": "inside of it is flexible, thanks to our slot here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.68,
          "end": 239.85,
          "en": "So now in managed goals, I wanna show that dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.85,
          "end": 242.93,
          "en": "if the user entered something invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.93,
          "end": 244.093,
          "en": "How could we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.36,
          "end": 248.2,
          "en": "Well, we could use v-if for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.2,
          "end": 250.193,
          "en": "We could manage some data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.49,
          "end": 254.943,
          "en": "in our managed goals component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.32,
          "end": 261.02,
          "en": "and have an InputIsInvalid data property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.02,
          "end": 263.32,
          "en": "which initially is false because initially,",
