        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 263.32,
          "end": 264.9,
          "en": "the input is not invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.9,
          "end": 267.443,
          "en": "After all the user hasn't entered anything yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.6,
          "end": 270.94,
          "en": "But we'll set this to true here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.94,
          "end": 274.15,
          "en": "if we see that what the user entered is invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.15,
          "end": 278.14300000000003,
          "en": "So we can then set this input is invalid to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 281.84000000000003,
          "end": 286.76,
          "en": "And now we wanna show our error alert here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 286.76,
          "end": 290.15999999999997,
          "en": "if input is invalid is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 290.15999999999997,
          "end": 292.53,
          "en": "So for that here in this template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.53,
          "end": 296.72,
          "en": "we could simply add error alert, this component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 296.72,
          "end": 298.32,
          "en": "and in order to use it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 298.32,
          "end": 301.65,
          "en": "of course, here we should import ErrorAlert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.65,
          "end": 306.65,
          "en": "from ./ErrorAlert.vue, not dot slash components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 307.52,
          "end": 310.5,
          "en": "but just dot slash error alert of Vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 310.5,
          "end": 313.84,
          "en": "because it's in the same folder as managed goals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 313.84,
          "end": 316.82,
          "en": "which is where I'm adding this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 316.82,
          "end": 320.9,
          "en": "And then we can register this as a local component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 320.9,
          "end": 324.12,
          "en": "It's the first time we're registering a local component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 324.12,
          "end": 327.43,
          "en": "outside of app.Vue, but as I mentioned earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 327.43,
          "end": 329.67,
          "en": "this is absolutely possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 329.67,
          "end": 332.69,
          "en": "So error alert is now a local component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 332.69,
          "end": 334.283,
          "en": "here in managed goals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 335.61,
          "end": 340.61,
          "en": "And now I only wanna output error alert if with v-if,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 341.07,
          "end": 345.27,
          "en": "if input is invalid is true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 345.27,
          "end": 350.27,
          "en": "And then in here we could have a title, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 350.95,
          "end": 354.42,
          "en": "input is invalid and a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 354.42,
          "end": 357.07,
          "en": "where we provide more information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 357.07,
          "end": 362.07,
          "en": "please enter at least a few characters, anything like that.",
