        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 373.7,
          "end": 376.44,
          "en": "if the user enters something invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 376.44,
          "end": 378.45,
          "en": "So if the user enters nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 378.45,
          "end": 381.47,
          "en": "then thanks to this data property and v-if,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 381.47,
          "end": 383.83299999999997,
          "en": "we show this error alert.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 384.75,
          "end": 386.17,
          "en": "Let's give it a try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 386.17,
          "end": 389.22,
          "en": "Let's save that, reload, go to manage goals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 389.22,
          "end": 392.59000000000003,
          "en": "and enter nothing, click set goal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 392.59000000000003,
          "end": 394.1,
          "en": "and we see nothing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 394.1,
          "end": 397.98,
          "en": "that's my bad though the built in dialogue element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 397.98,
          "end": 402.55,
          "en": "needs an open attribute to be displayed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 402.55,
          "end": 405.26,
          "en": "Therefore we could, of course, also display the visibility",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 405.26,
          "end": 408.49,
          "en": "of this dialogue by toggling the open attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 408.49,
          "end": 413.15,
          "en": "but I will always add open and instead just show or hide it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 413.15,
          "end": 416.67,
          "en": "by adding or removing the entire component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 416.67,
          "end": 419.01,
          "en": "to the dom with v-if.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 419.01,
          "end": 422.45,
          "en": "But make sure you have that open attribute on the dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 422.45,
          "end": 424.44,
          "en": "otherwise it won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
